  "text_pages": [
    "Communication and Media – Østfold University of Applied Sciences\nCommunication and Media\nThe communication and digital media program for exchange students offers a mix of theoretical knowledge and practical skills, fostering cross-cultural understanding and equipping students with the tools necessary to thrive in today's globalized media landscape.\nThe bachelor program in International Communication at Østfold University College in Norway, is launching a new programme for international students:\nAutumn\nSpring\n10 ECTS\n10 ECTS\n10 ECTS\n10 ECTS\n10 ECTS\n10 ECTS\nElective\nProfessional Communication\nCommunication Design\nPropaganda in the Era of Social Media\nCommunication and culture dissemination on digital platforms\nIntercultural Communication\nAll courses are taught at our campus in Halden.\nThe programme is an international alternative integrated into the ordinary curriculum, so you will meet and work with Norwegian students and companies all the time. Students may take the courses as a full-year study, single semester, or as individual courses.\nContact persons\nInternational coordinators\nMonica Kristensen Holone\nand\nLars Emil Skrimstad Knudsen\nPublished\nApr. 4, 2024 8:58 AM\n-\nLast modified\nMar. 16, 2026 9:47 AM\nE-mail this page\nShare on Facebook\nShare on X"
  ],
